 Maven Mar Plugin: configuration examples
 ------
 Jochen Wiedmann 
 <jochen.wiedmann@gmail.com>
 ------

Goals

  The Mar plugin allows the packaging of an Axis 2 module mar in 3 different modes:

   * mar (default): generates the mar artifact

   * inplace: package the mar in the source tree

   * exploded : package an exploded mar application

  Each mode is materialized by a goal. The plugin's goal prefix is axis2, which it
  shares with the other Axis2 plugins (the Aar plugin has goals with the same names),
  so invoke the goals with the full plugin coordinates. For instance, to generate an
  exploded mar from the current project, one would type

+--------
  mvn org.apache.axis2:axis2-mar-maven-plugin:exploded
+---------
